        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "2. What It Costs"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "One extra frame plus arg packing on every call",
            "Negligible for I/O work, measurable in tight numeric loops",
            "Tracebacks gain frames and step-through gets noisier",
            "`wraps` softens the debugging pain but cannot remove it"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "3. lru_cache Economics"
